# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sentinel Brief — .gitignore
# Public repo = source + deliverables only. Strategy/working docs and any
# environment/credential material are kept out of git history entirely so the
# private->public flip at submission is safe.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python venvs & build/cache artifacts ---
.venv/
.venv*/
**/.venv/
**/.venv*/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
**/*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
build/
dist/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Secrets / credentials / environment (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
*.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*-key.json
*credentials*.json
service-account*.json
adc.json
application_default_credentials.json
.secrets/

# --- Throwaway spike (references the dev GCP project; not a deliverable) ---
spike/

# --- Internal strategy / working docs (NOT public deliverables) ---
HACKATHON.md
PLAN.md
RECON.md
UNIQUE_IDEA.md
BUILD-LOG.md
LANE-A-CHECKLIST.md
DEMO-SCRIPT.md
CUE-CARD.md
COST-LOG.md

# --- Run logs (may echo the GCP project / live output; not deliverables) ---
*.log
**/*.log

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
